  Slug: supreme-incarnation
  DisplayName: Supreme Incarnation
  IconPath: icons/creatures/magical/construct-golem-stone-blue.webp
  Description: You become a nexus between the mortal and spiritual realms through
    which your apparition can embody its full might. You gain a 10th-rank apparition
    spell slot. In addition to heightened versions of your apparition spells, you
    can use this slot to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Avatar]. When
    you cast avatar in this way, you do not become an avatar of a deity; rather,
    your primary attuned apparition incarnates itself using your body, transforming
    you into the avatar described in your primary attuned apparition's entry.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder War of Immortals
